{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火一年前夕，今日（24日）下午起有市民自發到廣福道休憩處獻花悼念，有便衣警員拍攝前來獻花的市民。接近黃昏時警力明顯加強，不時有軍裝警員、民安隊員在宏福苑附近一帶巡邏。有前來獻花悼念的市民稱沒有擔心，只是想表達感受，反問「擺支花咋嘛，咁都唔畀呀？」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-2-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><em>宏福苑外圍一帶有軍裝警駐守，今日下午有市民到場獻花悼念時，有便衣警拍攝情況。</em></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>今日下午起，有市民自發到廣福道休憩處獻花，附近有兩名便衣警員駐守。現場所見休憩處一角放置了一個水桶，內有五、六束鮮花，亦有鮮花置放在休憩處不同角落；下午一名男士持白花到場、合起雙眼悼念，有便衣警拍攝作記錄。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p> <p> <p><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-3.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"333\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-3-500x333.jpeg\" width=\"500\"/></a></p><p><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-6.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"333\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-6-500x333.jpeg\" width=\"500\"/></a></p><p><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-7.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"333\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-7-500x333.jpeg\" width=\"500\"/></a></p> </p> </p>\n<p><em>宏福苑一帶不時有軍裝警、民安隊員巡視。</em></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Mike 今午到場眺望宏福苑、拍攝置放在樹旁的黃色菊花，記者上前了解時，兩名便衣警上前查問記者身分和機構、「做幾耐」等，亦有警員說「有人報你哋朝早喺度，晏晝仲喺度嘅？」。Mike 說朋友是宏福苑居民，指政務司司長<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e9%99%b3%e5%9c%8b%e5%9f%ba%e4%b8%8d%e9%98%bb%e5%90%88%e6%b3%95%e6%82%bc%e5%bf%b5-%e5%b8%82%e6%b0%91%e5%b0%8f%e5%bf%83%e9%81%b8%e6%93%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳國基表明合法悼念沒問題</a>，自己到場沒任何擔心，但指上星期曾來過拍攝，「佢哋（警方）當我不存在，但今日好似好警覺」，形容「敏感咗囉」。大火發生近一年，Mike 說對事件感無奈，「件事究竟係點，我諗比南丫海難更加唔清唔楚啦」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-5-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><em>Mike 指上周亦曾到場拍攝，但當時警方沒有理會，今日反應明顯「敏感咗」。</em></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>打擊樓宇維修工程圍標聯合特遣隊昨日（23日）展開第二次行動，拘捕 33 人涉嫌圍標，Mike 形容像以前警方「冚黃賭毒一樣，到時到候做場戲交下貨啫」；至於政府今日宣布向宏福苑業主、罹難者家屬派發「新生活支援補助」，他則覺得是「日子就快到，做啲嘢粉飾下」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-4-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p><em>自稱大埔街坊的夫婦亦到場獻花，說希望就事件表達感受。</em></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>一對自稱「大埔街坊」的夫婦亦到現場獻花，丈夫表示擔心是「多餘」，說「如果咁都搞到我就冇得講啦」，妻子亦說「擺支花咋嘛，咁都唔畀呀？」。丈夫強調，作為大埔街坊只是想表達感受，指「咁多部門夾埋一齊，又有環境、又有天氣先做成『完美風暴』」 ，即使有巧合因素、當權者亦難以推卸責任。他又質疑當局在一周年前夕「求其拉啲人」是希望「了咗件事，最緊要唔好搞大佢」，質疑政府尚未給苦主公道、又威迫利誘居民「揀樓」。他認為居民面對很大壓力，外人難以完全明白他們的感受，唯有寄語他們「堅強啲」、希望事情盡快過去。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-8-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>有市民帶大片幅相機為宏福苑拍攝留念。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261122_WanFukCourt-%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC-9-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p>相關報道：<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e5%90%91%e6%af%8f%e6%88%b6%e6%a5%ad%e4%b8%bb%e7%99%bc30%e8%90%ac%e6%96%b0%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%a3%9c%e5%8a%a9-%e7%bd%b9%e9%9b%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜向每戶業主發放 30 萬元「新生活」補助　罹難者家屬另獲發放 20 萬元</a><br/><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e9%99%b3%e5%9c%8b%e5%9f%ba%e4%b8%8d%e9%98%bb%e5%90%88%e6%b3%95%e6%82%bc%e5%bf%b5-%e5%b8%82%e6%b0%91%e5%b0%8f%e5%bf%83%e9%81%b8%e6%93%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜陳國基：不阻合法悼念，市民小心選擇　未回應官方悼念或「原址悼念」</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T12:04:10.796870+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1062,"images":9,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:50:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:14.238562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:57:15.402093+00:00","content_hash":"1c042dde4fa0716c434e8d4ff25bc55cf02bc2962b75daf032660a99d2a96e82","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}